[{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0031","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0102","title":"file 命令 readelf.c 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"file 命令的 readelf.c 中 tryelf() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户使用 file 命令解析特制的 ELF 文件时，攻击者可通过在 ELF 头部设置过大的 e_shentsize 字段值触发栈溢出，从而以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 file 3.x 及更早版本，攻击者需要诱使用户对恶意 ELF 文件执行 file 命令才能利用，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0102"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 file 程序包至修复版本：Red Hat Linux 安装 RHSA-2003:086/087 提供的 file-3.41-5.7 及以上版本，Debian 安装 DSA-260 提供的 file_3.41-4woody2 及以上版本，NetBSD 应用 SA2003-003 补丁，Ubuntu 升级至 4.16-0ubuntu3.2 及以上版本。如无法升级，避免对不可信 ELF 文件执行 file 命令，并限制普通用户运行 file 的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lwn.net/Alerts/34908/","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104680706201721&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-260","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/03.04.03.txt","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/611865","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:030","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_017_file.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-086.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-087.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7008","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11469","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22325","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0102.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0102.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0102","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0102","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0102.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0102","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0102.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0102","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2003/CVE-2003-0102.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2003/CVE-2003-0102.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0025","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0081","title":"Ethereal SOCKS解析器格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ethereal（现 Wireshark）的 SOCKS 协议解析器 packet-socks.c 中存在格式化字符串漏洞，版本 0.8.7 至 0.9.9 受影响。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的包含格式化字符串说明符的 SOCKS 数据包触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，危害严重。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0081"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:28Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.10 或更高版本（Debian 系统对应升级至 0.9.4-1/woody 或 0.9.9-2/unstable），该漏洞在 packet-socks.c 中因未对用户可控输入做格式化字符串过滤导致远程代码执行。如无法升级，建议禁用 SOCKS 协议解析器：在 Ethereal 首选项中将 SOCKS 协议设为禁用，或迁移至已修复此漏洞的 Wireshark 最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000627","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:051","http://seclists.org/lists/fulldisclosure/2003/Mar/0080.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-258","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00008.html","http://www.guninski.com/etherre.html","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/gentoo_advisory-2949.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_019_ethereal.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-076.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-077.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/7049","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11497","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A54","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0081","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a5f32c7015b5096d8cfd855ae981350d42219587/2003/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0081.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0081.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0081.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0021","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0077","title":"Hanterm hanterm-xf 终端模拟器命令执行漏洞","description":"hanterm-xf 终端模拟器 2.0.5 及更早版本存在转义序列注入漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含特殊转义序列的恶意文件，当用户使用 hanterm-xf 查看该文件时，终端窗口标题会被修改并回注入命令行，从而在用户终端中执行任意命令。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响范围包括所有使用受影响版本 hanterm-xf 的 Linux/Unix 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0077"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:28Z","remediation":"升级 hanterm-xf 至修复版本（Red Hat 已通过 RHSA-2003-070 和 RHSA-2003-071 发布补丁，对应更新后的 hanterm-xf 软件包已修复转义序列注入问题）。如无法升级，建议避免在 hanterm-xf 中查看或打开来自不可信来源的文本文件，或改用 xterm、GNOME Terminal 等持续维护的终端模拟器作为替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11414.php","http://www.osvdb.org/4917","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-070.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-071.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0077","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eaba6ba6891dae2972376e68ae56a38b641030d7/2003/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0077.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0077.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2003-0077.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0005","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0020","title":"Apache HTTP Server 终端转义序列注入漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 未对其错误日志中的终端转义序列进行过滤，攻击者可将精心构造的终端控制序列（如 ESC 转义码）通过请求头或请求内容注入到访问日志/错误日志中。当管理员使用存在相应转义序列处理漏洞的终端模拟器查看这些日志时，日志里嵌入的转义序列会被终端解释执行，从而能配合终端模拟器自身的漏洞触发任意操作，进一步可能导致被动的命令执行或造成管理员终端环境的敏感信息泄露。该漏洞实现攻击的前提条件是：攻击者能够向日志中注入包含转义序列的内容，同时管理员必须在其终端模拟器中查看相关日志；网络层面攻击复杂度较低、无需身份认证即可注入，但实际危害受限于终端模拟器是否受转义序列影响。该问题影响了 Apache 2.x 等多个版本的相关日志输出组件，CVSS 评分为 5.0，Red Hat 评估其危害等级为低，官方建议及时升级至受支持的安全版本并对日志呈现进行转义过滤加固。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0020"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:21Z","remediation":"建议将 Apache 升级至 2.0.48 或更高版本，该版本修复了错误日志中终端转义序列的处理；升级后可配置日志过滤，对错误日志中的 ESC (x1b) 转义字符进行净化或剔除，防止恶意序列进入终端模拟器。作为缓解措施，避免直接查看原始错误日志的终端或采用支持安全解析转义序列的工具查看日志，并在 Web 服务器层面限制错误日志中输入可打印字符之外的字节。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2004:046","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=108369640424244&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=108437852004207&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=108731648532365&w=2","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200405-22.xml","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-101555-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-57628-1","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11412.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:050","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-082.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-083.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-1