mp_sub_print 函数存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统监听的 UDP 500 端口发送特制的畸形 ISAKMP 数据包，触发解析器进入无限循环，导致 CPU 资源被耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 tcpdump 3.6、3.6.2、3.7、3.7.1 等多个版本，攻击条件简单（仅需网络可达），CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。官方建议升级至 tcpdump 3.8 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0108"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:32Z","remediation":"升级 tcpdump 至 3.7.2 或更高版本。Debian 用户安装 DSA-255 更新包，Red Hat 用户应用 RHSA-2003:032/RHSA-2003:085/RHSA-2003:214 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上限制 UDP 端口 500 的入站流量，或避免在不可信网络上以 root 权限运行 tcpdump 抓包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000629","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104637420104189&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104678787109030&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-255","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/02.27.03.txt","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11434.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:027","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_015_tcpdump.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-032.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-085.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6974","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22294","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0108.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0108","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0108.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0108","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0108","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0108","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0108.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/13ed3f592a10631c0caaa49cbae4f7b3f5d02049/2003/CVE-2003-0108.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0108.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0108.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0032","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0107","title":"Zlib 1.1.4 gzprintf 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Zlib 1.1.4 压缩库中的 gzprintf 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当 zlib 在编译时未启用 vsnprintf 安全函数，或使用 vsnprintf 截断过长输入时，攻击者可通过向 gzprintf 传递特制超长字符串触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 zlib 1.1.4 版本且未正确配置编译选项的应用程序，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0107"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:32Z","remediation":"建议立即将 zlib 升级至 1.2.2 或更高版本（当前最新为 1.3.2），该版本已使用安全的 vsnprintf 替代存在溢出的 vsprintf。如无法升级，可在编译时确保系统支持 vsnprintf 并定义 HAVE_VSNPRINTF，同时避免向 gzprintf() 传递超长不可信输入作为格式参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000619","http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN78689801/index.html","http://jvndb.jvn.jp/en/contents/2015/JVNDB-2015-000066.html","http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00038.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104610337726297&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104610536129508&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104620610427210&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104887247624907&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/312869","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retr