。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响 LBL tcpdump 3.4 至 3.6.2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至 tcpdump 3.7 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0093"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:30Z","remediation":"升级 tcpdump 至 3.7 及以上版本。各发行版用户：Debian 安装 dsa-261 更新，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2003:032/033/214 更新，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2003:027 更新。如无法升级，可在网络边界过滤来自 RADIUS 端口（1812/1813/UDP 1645/1646）的可疑报文作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-261","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:027","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-032.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-033.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=81585","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/11324","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0093","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2003/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0093.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0093.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0093.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0023","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0079","title":"Hanterm hanterm-xf 终端模拟器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"hanterm-xf 终端模拟器 2.0.5 之前版本中的 DEC UDK（用户定义键）处理功能存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向终端发送特制的转义序列，导致终端进入死循环，从而触发拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击条件要求本地访问权限，无需认证即可利用，影响系统可用性。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0079"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:28Z","remediation":"升级 hanterm-xf 至 2.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 DEC UDK 处理中的死循环缺陷。如无法升级，避免在终端中执行来源不明的转义序列，或考虑替换为其他终端模拟器（如 xterm、gnome-terminal）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11415.php","http://www.osvdb.org/4918","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-070.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-071.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6944","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0079","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2003/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0079.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0079.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2003-0079.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0022","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0078","title":"OpenSSL 0.9.x CBC错误信息泄露漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6i 及 0.9.7a 之前的版本在 SSLv3/TLS 协议实现中存在信息泄露漏洞，具体位于 ssl3_get_record 函数（s3_pkt.c）中。当使用不正确填充的密文块进行解密时，OpenSSL 会跳过消息认证码（MAC）的计算步骤，导致处理过程出现可测量的时间差异。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该时间差异，通过主动选择密文并测量服务器响应时间来区分填充错误与 MAC 验证错误，进而逐步推导出原始明文的加密内容。该漏洞影响所有使用 CBC 模式加密的 OpenSSL 服务，包括 HTTPS、SMTPS、IMAPS 等基于 SSL/TLS 的通信服务，攻击者需多次发送特制数据包进行统计分析，最终可能实现对加密数据的完整提取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0078"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:28Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7a 或 0.9.6i 及以上版本，该漏洞在 s3_pkt.c 中通过修复 MAC 计算逻辑已解决。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 TLS 响应时间引入随机延迟以缓解时序侧信道攻击，或使用支持恒定时间 MAC 校验的替代 TLS 实现（如 LibreSSL）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000570","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104567627211904&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104568426824439&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104577183206905&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-051.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-253","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11369.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2874.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:020","http://www.openssl.org/news/secadv_20030219.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/3945","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-062.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-063.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-082.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-104.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-205.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6884","http://www.trustix.org/errata/2003/0005","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22264","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2003/CVE-2003-0078.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2003/CVE-2003-0078.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2003/CVE-2003-0078.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0078.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0078","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0078","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/82b999fd586a119c783ecf948fd0f054f9999298/CVEs/2003/CVE-2003-0078.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2003/CVE-2003-0078.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0078","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0078"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0018","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0071","title":"XFree86 xterm DEC UDK 处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"XFree86 4.2.99.4 及之前版本中 xterm 终端模拟器的 DEC UDK（用户自定义键）处理功能存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向终端发送特制的字符转义序列，触发终端进入紧密循环（无限循环），导致终端无响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要本地访问权限，仅影响系统可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0071"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:27Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.3.0 及以上版本，或安装对应发行版安全更新：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2003-064/065/066/067 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-380 提供的 xfree86 更新包。如无法立即升级，可在 xterm 配置中禁用 DEC UDK 功能（设置 allowSendEvents: false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-380","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11415.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-064.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-065.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-066.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6950","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2008/CVE-2008-2383.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0071","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0071.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0071","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0071","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0071","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0071.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2003/CVE-2003-0071.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0071.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0017","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0070","title":"GNOME VTE 终端模拟器代码执行漏洞","description":"VTE（虚拟终端模拟器）在处理特定转义序列时存在命令注入漏洞。gnome-terminal 2.0/2.2 默认使用的 VTE 允许攻击者通过构造特殊的字符转义序列修改终端窗口标题，并将标题内容回插到用户终端的命令行中。当用户使用 cat、less 等命令查看包含恶意转义序列的文件时，该序列会被终端解析执行，导致攻击者在用户权限下执行任意命令。攻击者可借此窃取敏感信息、修改文件或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞无需认证，远程攻击者可通过诱使用户访问恶意文件触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0070"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:27Z","remediation":"升级 VTE 库至 0.11.10 及以上版本（Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get install libvte9`，Red Hat 执行 `yum update vte`）。如无法升级，可在终端模拟器配置中禁用窗口标题转义序列处理，或使用不受影响的终端模拟器（如 xterm）替代 gnome-terminal。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://seclists.org/lists/bugtraq/2003/Mar/0010.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11414.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-053.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2010/CVE-2010-2713.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0070","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/106a1fdac91d72807fea971dfa93d601744b9ae9/2003/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0070.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0070.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0070.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0016","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0066","title":"rxvt 终端模拟器窗口标题转义序列命令注入漏洞","description":"rxvt 终端模拟器 2.7.8 及更早版本存在转义序列注入漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意转义序列的文件，当用户使用 rxvt 查看该文件时，终端窗口标题会被修改并回注入命令行，从而在用户终端中执行任意命令。该漏洞允许远程攻击者在无需认证的情况下利用用户交互触发，实现机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0066"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:27Z","remediation":"升级 rxvt 至 2.7.9 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2003:054/RHSA-2003:055 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2003:003 更新。如无法升级，可在终端模拟器配置中禁用转义序列处理功能，或使用不受影响的终端模拟器（如 xterm）替代 rxvt。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11414.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:003","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-054.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-055.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/5137","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6953","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0066","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0066.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0066","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0066","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0066","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0066.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5ed23ad1e6e5869267a4c8091cffdf6711227b5/2003/CVE-2003-0066.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0066.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0066.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0015","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0063","title":"XFree86 xterm 终端模拟器转义序列注入漏洞","description":"XFree86 4.2.0 及之前版本中的 xterm 终端模拟器存在转义序列注入漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含特殊转义字符序列的恶意文件（如日志或文本文件），当用户使用 cat、less 等命令查看该文件时，xterm 会解析其中的转义序列并修改终端窗口标题，随后将标题内容回注入命令行缓冲区，导致任意命令在用户终端中执行。该漏洞利用条件为用户主动查看恶意文件，影响所有使用受影响 xterm 版本的 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0063"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:26Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.2.1 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2003:064/065/066/067 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-380 提供的 xfree86 更新包。如无法升级，可在 xterm 启动时添加 -xrm \"XTerm*allowTitleOps: false\" 参数禁用窗口标题转义序列操作，或使用其他终端模拟器（如 rxvt）替代 xterm。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-380","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11414.php","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/06/15/1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-064.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-065.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-066.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6940","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2008/CVE-2008-2383.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0063.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0063.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/SSVC/data/2003/CVE-2003-0063.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0063","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cec9fb1846e25b24020f297f65ec2360af0f4267/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0063.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2003-0063","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2003-0063","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0063.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2003-0063"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0007","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0023","title":"rxvt 菜单栏转义序列命令执行漏洞","description":"rxvt 终端模拟器 2.7.8 版本的 menuBar 功能存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者可通过向使用 menuBar 的 rxvt 会话发送特定字符转义序列，将恶意命令注入到菜单选项中，当用户点击被篡改的菜单项或终端处理该转义序列时，即可执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 rxvt 的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，利用复杂度低。CVSS 评分 5.0，影响范围为完整性破坏，可能导致攻击者在目标系统上获得与终端用户相当的执行权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0023"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:21Z","remediation":"建议升级 rxvt 至 2.7.9 或更高版本（已修复该转义序列注入问题）。若无法立即升级，可通过编译选项 `--disable-menubar` 禁用菜单栏功能，或在启动参数中添加 `-mb` 禁用菜单栏作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11416.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:034","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-054.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-055.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6947","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-0023","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2003/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2003/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7753953b586683c230526e07a6b8b2948b832025/2003/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/918ac66f0b50ab0d2a013bdf692688d3c0abefbc/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0023.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2003/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0023.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2003/CVE-2003-00xx/CVE-2003-0023.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2003/AVE-2003-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2003-0006","file_name":"2003/AVE-2003-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2003-0022","title":"rxvt 终端模拟器任意文件写入漏洞","description":"rxvt 2.7.8 的\"屏幕转储\"（screen dump）功能存在任意文件写入漏洞。该漏洞的成因是 rxvt 在处理特定字符转义序列时，未对目标文件名进行充分校验，攻击者可构造恶意转义序列，当该序列被回显到用户的终端时即可触发，例如用户查看包含该恶意序列的文件时，会在不怀意的情况下被诱导写入任意文件。攻击者无需任何认证，仅需诱使目标用户查看包含恶意转义序列的文件，即可覆盖系统上任意可写文件，可能导致数据破坏、任意代码植入等严重后果。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2003-0022"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-03-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:01:21Z","remediation":"立即将 rxvt 升级到 2.7.8 之后已修复该问题的版本（如 shipped 的 2.7.9 以上版本），并从软件源获取官方补丁包完成更新。若无法立即升级，可暂时禁用终端对转义序列的解析能力，或避免直接使用 cat 等命令查看来源不可信的文本文件，且不要在不可信输入中启用终端屏幕转储功能。同时建议限制终端程序在受控用户环境下运行，以防止恶意序列被回显时覆盖任意文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2003-q1/0093.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104612710031920&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/11413.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:034","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-054.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-055.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6938","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2003/0xxx/CVE-2003-0022.json","https://github.com/LiuCa